    "turn_idx": 36,
    "turn_text": "When I was in politics before going to the United States Senate, I got tired of hearing people say, how come we never see you? Now there's still thousands of people that say they never see me. But if I can say I've been to every corner of the state over 34 years now, and at the end of this week, I'll be in 40 counties this year. It's pretty difficult to say that, isn't it?",
